<title>UK: M.A.I.D has hotel agreement with 4th Network.</title>
<headline>M.A.I.D has hotel agreement with 4th Network.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British information provider M.A.I.D. Plc said on Monday it had signed an with Fourth Communications Network Inc to combine resources in the provosion of Internet based services to hotels on a global basis.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the alliance, M.A.I.D. will transfer its hotel Internet access technology and existing hotel contracts to Fourth Communications Network and become their agent in Europe.</p>
</text>
